eadsheet do you want to import?\",\"import-data-which-file-attach-to-document\":\"Which file should we attach to this document?\",\"import-sheets-data-authenticate\":\"Authenticate\",\"import-sheets-data-authenticate-retry\":\"Retry\",\"import-sheets-data-authenticate-text\":\"Lucidchart needs permission to access Google Sheets in order to import Sheets data.\",\"import-sheets-data-authenticate-title\":\"Google Sheets Permissions\",\"import-sheets-data-authentication-failed-text-v2\":\"Sorry, we weren’t able to connect to your Google account. Please check your internet connection and make sure <w0>Lucidchart has access to your account</w0>\",\"import-sheets-data-authentication-failed-title\":\"Google Sheets Authentication Failed\",\"in-workspace-onboarding-revisit-tip-v2\":\"Revisit this onboarding tutorial in the Help menu.\",\"integration-disabled-option\":\"This option has been disabled by your administrator.\",\"integration-disabled-v2\":\"This integration has been disabled by your {product} administrator.\",\"integration-marketplace-name-google-classroom\":\"Google Classroom\",\"intelligent-diagramming-suggestion-conditional-format-content\":\"Set line color with '{yes}' to green and '{no}' to red?\",\"intelligent-diagramming-suggestion-rule-name-line-color\":\"Line color\",\"intelligent-interface-contextual-panel-minimize\":\"Minimize properties panel\",\"intelligent-mind-map-layout-control-horizontal-layout\":\"Horizontal layout\",\"intelligent-mind-map-layout-control-set-layout\":\"Set layout\",\"intelligent-mind-map-layout-control-vertical-layout\":\"Vertical layout\",\"jira-authentication-add-instance-contact-admin\":\"To connect to a new Jira instance, please contact your account admin.\",\"jira-authentication-no-access-to-instance-contact-admin\":\"You don't have access to this Jira instance. Please contact support.\",\"jira-authentication-no-admin-credentials-v3\":\"Our Lucid Cards for Jira integration now supports live updates from Jira. To enable this functionality, please ask your account admin to configure your Jira instance in the Lucid admin panel.\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-both-fields-exceed-limits\":\"One or more selected shapes exceed Jira's character limits. Summary limit: {summaryLimit} characters, Description limit: {descriptionLimit} characters. Shorten the text before converting.\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-convert-button\":\"Convert\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-converting-button\":\"Converting...\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-description-exceeds-limit\":\"One or more selected shapes have descriptions exceeding Jira's limit of {limit} characters. Shorten the description text before converting.\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-description-text\":\"Text on each selected shape will be used as the description field in Jira.\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-empty-shapes-v2\":\"The shapes selected have an empty text field. To create Jira work items, text on shape is used as the 'summary' in Jira which is a required field.\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-next-button\":\"Next\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-summary\":\"Summary\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-summary-description\":\"Text on each selected shape will be used as the summary field in Jira.\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-summary-exceeds-limit\":\"One or more selected shapes have summaries exceeding Jira's limit of {limit} characters. Shorten the summary text before converting.\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-title-v2.one\":\"Convert {count} shape to Jira work item\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-title-v2.other\":\"Convert {count} shapes to Jira work items\",\"jira-bulk-conversion-ui-too-many-shapes\":\"We cannot convert more than {count} shapes at a time. Please select fewer shapes and try again.\",\"jira-callout-mapping-fields-onboarding\":\"Optimize your Jira integration by mapping data fields to Lucid.\",\"jira-cards-highlight-fields-description\":\"Manage your Lucid Cards for Jira settings here.\",\"jira-cards-spotlight-description-v4\":\"Lucid cards for Jira accelerates your 