version-ui-convert-button\":\"Convert\",\"jira-conversion-ui-converting-button\":\"Converting...\",\"jira-conversion-ui-description-v3\":\"Fill all required fields to convert and create a new Jira work item.\",\"jira-conversion-ui-next-button\":\"Next\",\"jira-conversion-ui-title-v2\":\"Convert to Jira work item\",\"jira-convert-into-jira-work-items-message-description\":\"Turn selected Lucid cards into Jira work items. Updates made in Jira will be reflected in Lucid and vice versa, keeping everything aligned.\",\"jira-convert-into-jira-work-items-message-header\":\"Convert your cards into Jira work items\",\"jira-create-data-service-authentication-error-but-created-v2\":\"Jira work item created but unable to create card as you have lost access to Jira. <w0>Sign in</w0> to re-authenticate and import your Jira work items.\",\"jira-create-data-service-rate-limit-exceeded-error-but-created-v2\":\"Jira work item created but unable to create card. You have tried to request data multiple times and hit your limit. Try importing later or contact support.\",\"jira-create-forbidden-error\":\"You do not have permission to import Jira data.\",\"jira-create-forbidden-error-but-created-v2\":\"Jira work item created but unable to create card as you do not have permission to import Jira data.\",\"jira-create-jira-api-error-v2\":\"Unable to create Jira work item. Your Jira instance returned the following error: \",\"jira-create-mapping-fields-failed-error\":\"Unable to create card. Contact support to get help with Jira integration.\",\"jira-create-mapping-fields-failed-error-but-created-v2\":\"Jira work item created but unable to create card. Contact support to get help.\",\"jira-create-unexpected-error\":\"Unable to create or import your Jira data. Try again later or contact support to get help.\",\"jira-create-unexpected-error-but-created-v2\":\"Jira work item created but unable to create card. Try importing the work item later or contact support to get help.\",\"jira-creating-wor