o pull a larger org chart.\",\"plugin-salesforce-search-placeholder\":\"Search contacts\",\"plugin-sticky-notes-import-button\":\"Import List\",\"plugin-task-management-library-name-v2\":\"Card\",\"plugin-timeline-time-unit-option-days\":\"Days\",\"plugin-timeline-time-unit-option-months\":\"Months\",\"plugin-timeline-time-unit-option-quarters\":\"Quarters\",\"plugin-timeline-time-unit-option-sprints\":\"Sprints\",\"plugin-timeline-time-unit-option-weeks\":\"Weeks\",\"plugin-uml-sequence-unsaved-changes-dialog-building\":\"Building...\",\"plugin-uml-sequence-unsaved-changes-dialog-content-v3\":\"Changes to your UML markup haven't been built. Choose to save or discard changes, but know that changes won't be saved if markup is invalid.\",\"plugin-uml-sequence-unsaved-changes-dialog-discard-changes-v2\":\"Discard\",\"plugin-uml-sequence-unsaved-changes-dialog-save-changes-v2\":\"Save changes\",\"plugin-uml-sequence-unsaved-changes-dialog-title-v2\":\"Unsaved changes\",\"plugin-video-chart-invalid-url\":\"Failed to parse video ID from URL: {url}\",\"plugin-video-chart-invalid-video-id\":\"The video id doesn't appear to be valid: {id}\",\"plugin-video-chart-you-tube\":\"YouTube Video\",\"position-options-position-x\":\"X Position\",\"position-options-position-y\":\"Y Position\",\"powerpoint-export-disabled-by-classification\":\"PowerPoint export is disabled due to this document's classification.\",\"powerpoint-export-disabled-no-slides\":\"Add Lucid slides to enable exporting as a PowerPoint deck.\",\"powerpoint-export-download\":\"Download PowerPoint deck\",\"powerpoint-export-spotlight-add-slide-button\":\"Add slide\",\"powerpoint-export-spotlight-description\":\"Each Lucid slide will be exported as an image within a new PowerPoint deck.\",\"powerpoint-export-spotlight-header\":\"For export to Microsoft PowerPoint, add Lucid slides\",\"presentation-hand-off-acceptee-fallback-name\":\"the person\",\"presentation-hand-off-waiting-growl-message\":\"Waiting for {name} to accept the presentation...\",\"presentation-overlay-preview-tooltip\":\"Slide preview\",\"presenter-settings-title\":\"Presenter controls\",\"presenting-status-hand-off-callout-button-text-v3\":\"Change presenters\",\"press-discover-menu-file-rename\":\"rename, rename document, document name, change title, change name\",\"press-discover-menu-insert-comment\":\"insert comment, add comment, new comment\",\"process-agent-standard-intro\":\"Hi there! I'm Lucid's Process Agent — I'm here to help you capture and visualize your workflow. Here is how we will work together:\\n\\n1. <w0>Describe your process</w0>: Tell me what you know, even if it's rough or incomplete.\\n2. <w1>I'll fill in the gaps</w1>: I'll ask clarifying questions to understand the logic and roles.\\n3. <w2>We'll build the diagram</w2>: I will generate a process diagram that we can refine together.\\n\\nIn the chat below, talk me through your process or upload a file to get started!\",\"product-end-of-trial-team-member-banner-v2.one\":\"Take advantage of your all-access {product} trial for {count} more day! To keep edit access on documents after the trial ends, <w0>follow up on your license request.</w0>\",\"product-end-of-trial-team-member-banner-v2.other\":\"Take advantage of your all-access {product} trial for {count} more days! To keep edit access on documents after the trial ends, <w0>follow up on your license request.</w0>\",\"product-name-spark\":\"Lucidspark\",\"profile-shape-search-assign-fail-message\":\"Unable to assign profile shape. There might be a mismatch between the user name and email or an issue with your integration. Try again.\",\"progress-tracking-shapes-callout-header\":\"Planning and tracking\",\"progress-tracking-shapes-load-tracking-hover-tooltip-no-column-name\":\"Sum of estimates in this column\",\"progress-tracking-shapes-load-tracking-hover-tooltip-with-column-name\":\"Sum of estimates in the \\\"{columnName}\\\" column\",\"proxy-shape-interaction-copy-of-selected-shape-tip\":\"This shape is a copy of the selected shape\",\"publish-to-repository-modal-approvers-request-approval\":\"Request approval\",\"publish-to-repository-modal-browse\":\"Browse\",\"publish-to-repository-modal-ellipses-aria-label\":\"Full folder path\",\"publish-to-repository-modal-header\":\"Request approval\",\"publish-to-repository-modal-publishing-to\":\"Publishing to\",\"publish-to-repository-modal-pull-request-create-failed\":\"An approval request for this process is already in progress. Please wait for it to be resolved before submitting a new request.\",\"publish-to-repository-modal-pull-request-created\":\"Request submitted! Approvers have been notified.\",\"publish-to-repository-modal-repository-full-folder-path-title\":\"Full folder path\",\"publish-to-repository-modal-select-folder\":\"Select a folder (optional)\",\"publish-to-repository-modal-select-repository\":\"Select a repository to publish to\",\"publish-to-repository-modal-select-repository-default\":\"Select a repository\",\"pull-request-publish\":\"Publish\",\"pull-request-publish-directly\":\"Publish directly\",\"pull-request-request-approval\":\"Request approval\",\"pull-request-request-approval-disabled-tooltip\":\"You must be the owner of this document to submit it for approval\",\"pull-request-request-approval-tooltip\":\"Send this document to reviewers for approval.\",\"quick-action-convert-to-jira-work-item\":\"Convert to Jira work items\",\"remove-group-screen-reader-text\":\"Shape library group removed.\",\"repository-branch-confirm-text-v2\":\"To suggest edits to this process, you'll need to create a draft.\\nYour draft will appear in your documents list, where you can make changes before submitting it for review.\",\"repository-branch-confirm-title\":\"Create a draft to edit\",\"repository-branch-confirm-yes\":\"Create draft\",\"repository-branch-default-name\":\"Draft of <w0>{originalName}</w0>\",\"repository-direct-publish-overlay-title\":\"<w0>Draft:</w0> You're proposing a new or updated process. Select <w1>Publish</w1> to add your process to the <w2>{repositoryName}</w2> repository.\",\"repository-direct-publish-overlay-title-backup\":\"<w0>Draft:</w0> You're proposing a new or updated process. Select <w1>Publish</w1> to add your process to the repository.\",\"repository-draft-denied-overlay-title\":\"<w0>Denied:</w0> Review feedback in the comments, select <w1>Edit draft</w1> to update, and resubmit for approval.\",\"repository-draft-overlay-title-tiny-v2\":\"<w0>Draft:</w0> You're proposing a new or updated process.\",\"repository-draft-overlay-title-v2\":\"<w0>Draft:</w0> You're proposing a new or updated process. Approval is required before publishing.\",\"repository-draft-withdrawn-overlay-title\":\"<w0>Draft:</w0> Your approval request was withdrawn while you edit. Select <w1>Request approval</w1> to send this revision for review.\",\"repository-overlay-editing-in-progress-title\":\"<w0>Editing in progress:</w0> The author is updating the draft. You'll be notified when it's ready for review.\",\"repository-process-create-new-branch-label-v2\":\"Suggest edits\",\"repository-reviewer-draft-denied-overlay-title\":\"<w0>Denied: {name}</w0> denied this request. The author may make changes and resubmit. You can still leave feedback as comments.\",\"repository-reviewer-draft-denied-overlay-title-tiny\":\"<w0>Denied: {name}</w0> denied this request. The author may make changes and resubmit.\",\"repository-reviewer-draft-denied-overlay-title-without-users-name\":\"<w0>Denied: A reviewer</w0> denied this request. The author may make changes and resubmit. You can still leave feedback as comments.\",\"repository-reviewer-draft-denied-overlay-title-without-users-name-tiny\":\"<w0>Denied: A reviewer</w0> denied this request. The author may make changes and resubmit.\",\"resizable-left-panel-back-to-shapes\":\"Back\",\"resizable-left-panel-back-to-shapes-aria-label\":\"Back to shapes\",\"resize-frame-to-fit-spotlight-description\":\"Double-click any f